! v0.73.0 PCM test 6:  OH radical in water (UHF/STO-3G, C-PCM).
!
! Open-shell + PCM:  exercises the UHF code path in run_scf_uhf with
! the same V_pcm added to BOTH F_alpha and F_beta (single one-electron
! operator, no spin dependence).  V_solute is computed from the total
! density Pa + Pb (open-shell convention), so the charges respond to
! the spin-summed density.  The <S^2> output verifies the spin state
! is preserved through the PCM coupling.
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%spin    unrestricted
%charge  0
%mult    2
%job     energy
%pcm     cpcm     ! v0.74+ default is iefpcm; v0.73 tests pin cpcm explicitly
%solvent water
%geom angstrom
O  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H  0.000000   0.000000   0.970000
*end
